{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32429","headline":"寒食节日寄楚望二首 二 · 温庭筠","name":"寒食节日寄楚望二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家乏两千万，时当一百五。\n颸颸杨柳风，穰穰樱桃雨。\n年芳苦沈潦，心事如摧橹。\n金犊近兰汀，铜龙接花坞。\n青葱建杨宅，隐辚端门鼓。\n彩素拂庭柯，轻球落邻圃。\n三春谢游衍，一笑牵规矩。\n独有恩泽侯，归来看楚舞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}